{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And fire came forth from before YHWH</b> — The sense of \"from before YHWH\" (מִלִּפְנֵי ה') is like \"from the presence of YHWH\" (מֵאֵת פְּנֵי ה'). And the enlightened will understand, for I have already explained this (Exodus 30:1). As for this sin of Nadav and Avihu, you will know it from what it says: \"And they offered before YHWH alien fire\" ( Leviticus 10:1), and it does not say \"and they offered before YHWH incense which He had not commanded them.\" Now, they placed incense upon the fire, in the manner that Scripture states (Deuteronomy 33:10): \"They shall place incense in Your nostril,\" yet they did not set their minds only to this. And behold, there was no ignition of a pleasing fragrance. And this is the sense of \"and they put incense upon it\" (וַיָּשִׂימוּ עָלֶיהָ קְטֹרֶת) — that it does not say \"upon them\" (עֲלֵיהֶן), as is said regarding the congregation of Korah (Numbers 16:7): \"and put fire in them and place incense upon them\" (וּתְנוּ בָהֵן אֵשׁ וְשִׂימוּ עֲלֵיהֶן קְטֹרֶת), and there further: \"and you shall place upon them incense\" (וּנְתַתֶּם עֲלֵיהֶם קְטֹרֶת) (ibid. v. 17). But here it says \"upon it\" (עָלֶיהָ), to hint that upon the fire alone they placed incense. \"And fire came forth from before YHWH and consumed them.\" And it is possible that this alludes to what it says (Exodus 30:9): \"You shall not offer upon it alien incense\" (לֹא תַעֲלוּ עָלָיו קְטֹרֶת זָרָה) — that they should not make it alien. And this is what is said (Leviticus 16:1): \"when they approached before YHWH and they died,\" for in their approaching before Him they died."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "The cross-reference to Exodus 30:1 is given as שמות ל א in the Hebrew, which resolves the abbreviation ל to chapter 30; the surrounding argument about the incense altar and alien incense confirms this."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:52:11.383688757Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}